{"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLTremolo","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL10MXLTremoloV","title":"MXLTremolo","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLTremolo"}],"symbolKind":"struct","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tremolo ornament can be used to indicate single-note, double-note, or unmeasured tremolos. Single-note"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tremolos use the single type, double-note tremolos use the start and stop types, and unmeasured tremolos use"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the unmeasured type. The default is “single” for compatibility with Version 1.1. The text of the element"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"indicates the number of tremolo marks and is an integer from 0 to 8. Note that the number of attached beams is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not included in this value, but is represented separately using the beam element. The value should be 0 for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"unmeasured tremolos."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/SH","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo\/init(value:kind:position:font:color:placement:smufl:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo\/color","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo\/font","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo\/kind-swift.property","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo\/placement","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo\/position","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo\/smufl","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo\/value"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo\/Kind-swift.enum"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumerations","title":"Enumerations"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLTremolo\/Equatable-Implementations"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLTremolo"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When using double-note tremolos, the duration of each note in the tremolo should correspond to half of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"notated type value. A time-modification element should also be added with an actual-notes value of 2 and a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"normal-notes value of 1. If used within a tuplet, this 2\/1 ratio should be multiplied by the existing tuplet"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ratio."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The smufl attribute specifies the glyph to use from the SMuFL Tremolos range for an unmeasured tremolo. It is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored for other tremolo types. The SMuFL buzzRoll glyph is used by default if the attribute is missing."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Using repeater beams for indicating tremolos is deprecated as of MusicXML 3.0."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps the MusicXML "},{"code":"<tremolo>","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" element."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltremolo"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLTremolo/init(value:kind:position:font:color:placement:smufl:)":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxltremolo\/init(value:kind:position:font:color:placement:smufl:)","title":"init(value:kind:position:font:color:placement:smufl:)","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"value"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL15MXLTremoloMarksV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLTremoloMarks"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"kind"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL10MXLTremoloV4KindO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Kind"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"position"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL11MXLPositionV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLPosition"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"font"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLFontV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLFont"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"color"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL8MXLColorV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLColor"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"placement"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL13MXLAboveBelowO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MXLAboveBelow"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalPa